# No branches — ever

NEVER create a git branch in this project, in either repo (the parent
`luna-linear-ascent` repo or the `plugin-linear-ascent` submodule). This
overrides any plan doc or skill (e.g. devprocess) that says to branch.

- Commit directly to `main` and push to `origin main`.
- Do not use `git checkout -b`, `git branch <name>`, or `git switch -c`.
- If a plan says "create a branch matching the plan folder name", skip that
  step and work on `main`.
